; FFX PAL (SCES_504.90) VU1 Microprogram 2 — Scene / Map Renderer & 3D Clipper
; VMA: 0x00579b00..0x0057c640 (11,072 B packet + 64 B zero trailer/padding)
; Instructions: 1,376 VU1 instructions across 6 VIF MPG chunks (0x0000..0x2b00)
; DMA tag: next qwc=691 addr=0x00000000 (symbol D_00579B00)
;
; Entry-Point Dispatch Table (invoked via VIF MSCAL <vu_addr/8>):
;   0x0000 (MSCAL  0): L_01b0 — Pipeline 0: Matrix setup + triangle-list renderer
;                               (pre-lit / UV-mode / color-scale + 3D clipper)
;   0x0010 (MSCAL  2): L_0e38 — Pipeline 1: Matrix setup + lit triangle-list renderer
;   0x0020 (MSCAL  4): L_14e8 — Pipeline 2: Lit & clipped triangle-list renderer
;   0x0030 (MSCAL  6): L_0080 — Idle / NOP halt stub
;   0x0040 (MSCAL  8): L_0080 — Idle / NOP halt stub
;   0x0050 (MSCAL 10): L_00b0 — Clear VU1 data memory (1,024 qwords = 16 KB)
;   0x0060 (MSCAL 12): L_0118 — Busy-wait delay loop (0x7fff iterations)
;   0x0070 (MSCAL 14): L_0160 — Direct GS passthrough kick (XTOP -> XGKICK)
;
; Major Subroutines:
;   L_0c38: Clear VU1 vector registers (vf01..vf31)
;   L_0d58: 4x4 matrix multiply ([vi03] = [vi01] * [vi02])
;   L_03a8 / L_1060 / L_1750: Triangle transform, perspective divide, fog,
;                             backface cull (OPMULA/OPMSUB), CLIPw, XGKICK
;   L_0680 / L_1c80: Vertex color scale/bias + [0, 255] clamp
;   L_0790: Procedural UV / vertex-attribute mode dispatch (L_0808/08f8/0a38/0b78)
;   L_1d90..L_2af8: Full 3D Sutherland-Hodgman frustum clipper (5 planes:
;                   L_2618 near-Z, L_23f8 +/-X, L_2508 +/-Y; edge interpolation
;                   at L_2870 / L_2958 / L_2a40) + fan triangulation + XGKICK
; ============================================================================

